{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56084","headline":"贺府主令公甘雨应祈 · 杜光庭","name":"贺府主令公甘雨应祈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一炷名香达杳冥，旋闻风雨应精诚。\n染来山岳千重翠，洗尽尘埃六合清。\n不独旱苗苏壠亩，便期嘉谷遍寰瀛。\n须知至理调元化，丞相爲霖致太平。\n（宋吕祖谦《诗律武库後集》卷十。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56084.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56084","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}